WEBVTT

00:01:47.842 --> 00:01:49.663
<v><b>E:</b></v> Nice shirt.

00:01:50.127 --> 00:01:52.217
But I’m not sure about those sneakers.

00:02:01.670 --> 00:02:02.271
<v><b>B:</b></v> Hey, Izzy!

00:02:05.161 --> 00:02:06.035
Yeah, I’m with Emma.

00:02:07.661 --> 00:02:10.840
We’re going for a walk…Yeah…Yeah…

00:02:12.944 --> 00:02:14.619
So do you want to come and meet us?

00:02:18.369 --> 00:02:18.672
Oh.

00:02:20.483 --> 00:02:20.869
OK.

00:02:22.178 --> 00:02:22.608
OK.

00:02:26.719 --> 00:02:27.344
See you later.

00:02:31.191 --> 00:02:32.807
Izzy’s working from home today.

00:02:34.023 --> 00:02:34.853
<v><b>E:</b></v> On a Saturday?

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:36.948
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yeah.

00:02:38.047 --> 00:02:39.360
<v><b>E:</b></v> What a surprise.

00:02:42.881 --> 00:02:45.064
Anyway…How are things with you?

00:02:45.825 --> 00:02:47.978
<v><b>B:</b></v> Izzy’s doing really well at the new job.

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:50.186
I think they’re going to give her a promotion.

00:02:50.767 --> 00:02:52.696
And she’s looking at new apartments, too.

00:02:53.643 --> 00:02:55.684
<v><b>E:</b></v> OK, that’s how Izzy’s doing.

00:02:56.182 --> 00:02:57.442
I asked about you.

00:02:58.242 --> 00:02:59.463
<v><b>B:</b></v> Well, I’m fine.

00:03:01.011 --> 00:03:02.144
<v><b>E:</b></v> Yeah, sure you are.

00:03:02.691 --> 00:03:03.936
<v><b>B:</b></v> What do you mean by that?

00:03:04.757 --> 00:03:09.155
<v><b>E:</b></v> It’s just…everything seems to be about Izzy right now.

00:03:09.502 --> 00:03:10.889
Her new job.

00:03:11.294 --> 00:03:12.637
Her new apartment.

00:03:12.842 --> 00:03:13.962
Her new life.

00:03:14.751 --> 00:03:16.724
Make sure there’s enough room for you, too.

00:03:16.953 --> 00:03:18.999
<v><b>B:</b></v> There is enough room for me.

00:03:20.015 --> 00:03:20.865
We’re OK.

00:03:21.015 --> 00:03:23.775
I mean, I’m OK.

00:03:24.746 --> 00:03:26.245
She’s just busy right now.

00:03:27.798 --> 00:03:29.575
<v><b>E:</b></v> You don’t spend enough time together.

00:03:30.273 --> 00:03:33.256
<v><b>B:</b></v> Well, we’re going to go away for a weekend soon.

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:34.756
Just the two of us.

00:03:35.674 --> 00:03:36.807
When she’s less busy.

00:03:37.935 --> 00:03:43.067
<v><b>E:</b></v> And when she gets this promotion, is she going to be less busy and have more time for you?

00:03:46.094 --> 00:03:46.392
<v><b>B:</b></v> Wait.

00:03:47.759 --> 00:03:48.623
I know where we are.

00:03:49.761 --> 00:03:50.508
Just around the corner.

00:03:50.771 --> 00:03:51.298
Come on.

00:03:53.745 --> 00:03:54.233
<v><b>E:</b></v> Ben.

00:04:00.986 --> 00:04:02.363
What a cute store.

00:04:02.426 --> 00:04:03.632
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yeah, it’s great.

00:04:04.307 --> 00:04:06.006
I came here once with Izzy.

00:04:06.914 --> 00:04:07.695
Do you want to go in?

00:04:09.175 --> 00:04:09.995
<v><b>E:</b></v> Sure.

00:04:10.845 --> 00:04:12.800
But you haven’t answered my question.